Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.18,0:00:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看过我们的银行对帐单了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you seen our bank statement?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会出错了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can this be right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. God,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了我小时候  双层夹心饼上市那会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I haven't seen my savings take a hit like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的存款就没这么少过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}since I was a kid and they came up with Double Stuf Oreos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的存款哪去了呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened to all of our money?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚他们做了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not sure exactly what they did...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我倾向于责怪安然公司倒闭案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I'm inclined to blame Enron.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概因为你在做实习工\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess with you doing the internship,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们有些入不敷出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we're spending more than we're bringing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  或许我应该辞掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, maybe I should quit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找个有薪水的工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and get a job that pays.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可你总算找到你喜欢的工作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you're finally doing something that you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能要求你放弃的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I can't ask you to give that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你喜欢做的工作是挖金子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Although it would be nice if the thing that you loved
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}was finding gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们太小题大作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I think we're making too big a deal out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这个月迟些付账单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll pay our bills late this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下个月我们就节省一些开销\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Next month we'll cut back on a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且或许我们可以变换一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And maybe we start eating out of Joey's refrigerator
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.91,0:00:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到乔伊家的冰箱找食物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:00:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是大厨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're a chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.87,0:00:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用苏打粉跟啤酒你会做什么菜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What can you make out of baking soda and beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最糟糕的情况下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Worst-case scenario is,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只好找我父母借钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we borrow some money from my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可以  而且我们也不借钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, and we're not borrowing money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么   -我们是宾家人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Why not? -We don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宾家人从不跟人借钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are Bings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸唯一教会我的事  就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If there's one thing my father taught me, it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去别人家泳池之前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}well, to always knock
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要先敲门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}before going into the pool house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  永远都不要向人借钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The other thing is, never borrow money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你这么有自尊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had no idea you had this much pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我有  我是你男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right, I do. I am your man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让我们度过难关的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna get us through this situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算你要加倍努力地工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}even if it means you working twice as hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.43,0:01:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《老友记》  第九季 第16集  隆胸记\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends S09E16 The One With The Boob Job
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我要回去了  -为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- I'm gonna go.  - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有好几天没有回家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I haven't been home in days,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我需要多拿几件衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I need to get more clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有衣服可以给你穿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have something that'll fit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我穿女生的紧身衣  是在逗你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I put that tube top on as a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要你留下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想要留下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to stay too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是这几条内裤我都穿遍了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I've got as much use out of these boxers as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-要不反过来再穿呢  -已经反过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Why don't you turn them inside  - Done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我几个小时之后就回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be back in a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我会想你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我刚惊觉到一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I just realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想回家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  好的  我去拿紧身衣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great! Okay, I'll go get the tube top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我的意思是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, what I mean is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢回去自己的公寓里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hate going back to my apartment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一方面是因为  我住的房间又小又乱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Partly because I live above a known crack den...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:03:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  主要是因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but, you know, mostly because when I'm there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.31,0:03:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我回去的时候  真的好想你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们同居好不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}do you want to move in together?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  迈克·汉尼根\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, Mike Hanigan...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.24,0:03:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你倒真有两把刷子  让女生说"好耶"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you sure know how to make a girl say ''Hell, yeah.''
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们要这样做吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So we're doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  就这样  让我们住在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, let's do it. Let's live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的要同居了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're really gonna move in together?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都想要跟男生同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've always wanted to live with a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.26,0:03:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,袜子捡起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pick up your socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把马桶圈给我放下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Put down the toilet seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我再也不能再做爱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, we are not having sex anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定会很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嘿  乔伊  -嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Hey, Joey.  - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我要你跟我保证\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I need to know that what
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一会我要拜托你的事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm about to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.07,0:03:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远都不会告诉钱德勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}will never get back to Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果说我  没有想过那件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd be lying if I said I hadn't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是骗你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}thought about it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是钱德勒是我最好的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But Chandler is my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是不对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It would be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉应该不错  却是不对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good, but wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  首先  感觉会是棒翻天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, first of all, it would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.41,0:04:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那不是我说的事  我要跟你借钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But that's not what I'm here to talk to you about. I need to borrow money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.95,0:04:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不好说  莫妮卡  你知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I don't know, Monica. You know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,借钱给朋友不是什么好事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}lending friends money is always a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是钱德勒借过你钱啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But Chandler lent you money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而他也会告诉你  那不是什么好事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And he would tell you it was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  我只是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, I just....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要付房租跟一些帐单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need it for some rent and some other bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.41,0:04:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多少钱呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.15,0:04:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两千块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two thousand dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.69,0:04:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两千块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two thousand dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.16,0:04:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我是谁  肥皂剧明星吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you think I am, a soap opera star?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -没错  我就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Yeah.  - That's right, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嗨  你们好  -嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Hi, you guys.  - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,袋子里是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's in the bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾玛已经开始会爬了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how Emma started crawling?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这个地方  对婴儿很不安全\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I realized that this place is very unsafe for a baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我去店里买了些东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I went to the store
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以保护婴儿在公寓里活动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I got some stuff to baby-proof the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  天啊  保护婴儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God, baby-proofing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.81,0:05:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么了不起的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why is it such a big deal now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我小的时候  经常发生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, when I was a kid, it was like:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"哎呀  乔伊跌下楼梯了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}''Whoops, Joey fell down the stairs.''
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.99,0:05:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者  "糟糕  乔伊又电到自己了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or, ''Whoops, Joey electrocuted himself again.''
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要找人帮忙装这些东西吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, are you going to get a handyman to install this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我自己来就行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I was just gonna do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.93,0:05:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你要自己来  -是啊  不行吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- You're gonna do it?  - Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得女人做不来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't think a woman can do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女人可以  你不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Women can. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮卡  请你告诉乔伊  他是猪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, will you please tell Joey that he is a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.17,0:05:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是猪  而你做不来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're a pig. And you can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.13,0:05:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  我自己都找到五金店了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Come on, I found the hardware store all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五金店不就在街角嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The store's right down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.83,0:05:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,街角就有五金店啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There is a hardware store right down the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.94,0:05:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  各位  我们有好消息要宣布\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys? Okay, we've got great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比跟我要搬到一起了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe and I are moving in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好兴奋  我从来都没跟男生同居过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, it's so exciting. You know, I've never lived with a guy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实跟女生同居是一样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's just like living with a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是他们不会偷用你的化妆品\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}only they don't steal your makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非他们扮演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless they're playing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.17,0:06:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我要有妹妹  她长什么样"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}''This Is What My Sister Would Look Like.''
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妹长得不是很可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, she's not so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去洗手间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上完把马桶坐垫放下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you put down the toilet seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你们在玩的游戏吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that a bit you guys do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我们在模仿你们俩个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. We're playing you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.55,0:06:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们才没有那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她  我们没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell her we don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.97,0:06:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信你们要同居了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you're moving in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真替你们高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm happy for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到婚礼进行曲了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hear wedding bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮卡  别急好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, slow down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是很兴奋要跟他同居了而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just excited to be living with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  我是说  我不知道...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I mean, I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能预见  有天跟迈克结婚吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...can I see someday being married to Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以想像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could picture myself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿着婚纱走在红毯上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}walking down the aisle in a wedding dress...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚纱主要突显我的胸部\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}.that highlights my breasts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是是很高雅的爆乳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in an obvious yet classy way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.39,0:06:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但问我想不想要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But do I want
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:06:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在康乃狄克州的好学区附近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that house in Connecticut near
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.97,0:07:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有所房子...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the good schools...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克可以和我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...where Mike and I could
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送我们的小苏菲  跟小迈克去上学\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}send little Sophie and Mike Jr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  我的天  我愿意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不晓得你是这么传统的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had no idea you were so conventional.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也没想到  大概我是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  开着沃尔沃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, load up the Volvo,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是中产阶级妇女了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to be a soccer mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好要走了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然好了  新室友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you bet, roomie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说"新郎"吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you mean ''groomie''?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.39,0:07:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你们在说什么  -拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- What are you talking about?  - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙  我们都还没一起住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These guys. We haven't even moved in yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就要我们选结婚用的瓷器了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and they have us picking out china patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结婚用的瓷器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}China patterns!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很容易嘛  还说"你不行..."\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is easy. ''Can't do this....''
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.30,0:07:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  还真的咧  就是不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, seriously. Can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嘿  乔伊  -嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Hey, Joe.  - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我需要你帮个忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I need to ask you a favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且不能跟莫妮卡说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and we can't tell Monica anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.62,0:08:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你们之间没有秘密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you guys didn't have secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.31,0:08:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,官方说法上是那样没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That will remain the official party line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.01,0:08:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮卡跟我  有一点点经济上的问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Monica and I are having a little financial trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.77,0:08:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你怎么知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜的  你知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just figured it out, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有工作  而且现在经济又很萧条\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you're not working, and the economy is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我反应最快的一次了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is the fastest I have ever thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要跟你借点钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need to borrow some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以  多少钱  两千块吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, sure. Yeah, how much? Two thousand dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  正是两千块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, $2000 exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你之前赚多少钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know how much you used to make,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我也知道你们的房租\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I know how much your rent is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真是天才\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, this is really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是开了一张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you write a check
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两千块的支票给莫妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to Monica for $2000?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.89,0:09:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮卡跟你借钱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did Monica borrow money from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.65,0:09:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信她竟然这样做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她跟你说我们经济出问题了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did she tell you we were having money problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是为了你们的经济问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. It wasn't because of your money problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是她自己的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was for something for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很私人的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Something personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要买两千块的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What would she get for $2000
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不能告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that she wouldn't tell me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,隆乳手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boob job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,隆乳手术  她根本不需要啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A boob job? She doesn't need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.87,0:09:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太疯狂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不算太疯狂  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's not that crazy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.99,0:09:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把咪咪变小才叫做疯狂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Making them smaller, that would be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我想要问你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, I wanted to ask you about
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于莫妮卡"新郎"的玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica's little ''groomie'' joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:10:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想大家会笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I think the reason people laughed is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为"新室友"和"新郎"音近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that it's a play on the word ''roomie.''
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听得懂这个笑话  真是高深啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I get the joke. Sophisticated as it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.05,0:10:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我要说的是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, the thing I want to say is....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们之前就应该先谈过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe we should've talked about this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们同居之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Us living together,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有期望我会求婚吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you're not expecting a proposal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-哦  不  一点也没有  -好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Oh, no, no. Not at all.  - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们才刚搬进来一起住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're just moving in right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将来怎样顺其自然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll see where it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  这就是个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我而言  这已经是我的极限了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For me, it's as far as it can ever go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  菲比  我...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Phoebe, I....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常爱你  但我不想再结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you very much. But I never want to get married again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是我的第一次婚姻太...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just, my first marriage was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太糟糕了  我已经对婚姻失去信心了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you know, such a disaster that I kind of lost faith in the whole idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有那么糟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was it that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到最后...有一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}At one point, near the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.18,0:10:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她故意便便在我的...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}she deliberately defecated on my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  那真糟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, that's bad. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But don't you think it might be different
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换个人会不一样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with someone else? Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许是一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}a blond
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会在厕所便便的金发女郎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}who always uses the toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了便在海里的那次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Except for once in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  不是结婚对象是谁的问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, it's not about who I would marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.56,0:11:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我第一次结婚的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was certain the first time I got married
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.27,0:11:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我坚信会白头到老  但我错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it'd last forever. I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, it just
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  问题不在你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Phoebe, it's not about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是再也不想结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just never want to get married again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.70,0:11:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你介意吗  如果你介意的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay with that? If not,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们同居  不是个好主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}maybe us moving in together isn't the best idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.95,0:11:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以  哦  我当然不想结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Oh, I definitely don't want to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想确定你也不想结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanted to make sure you didn't want to, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果我们住在一起了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because if we move in
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你再开始改变主意...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and you start changing your mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就有麻烦了  先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...there is gonna be hell to pay, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我永远不...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Trust me. I will never
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I get that. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.38,0:12:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  最后你决定请人来帮忙了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. So you gave in and decided to call someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.32,0:12:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  不知道我当时在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I don't know who I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我连筷子都不会用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can barely use chopsticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.34,0:12:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-都装好了  -非常感谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- You're all set.  - Oh, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你忘了你的...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. You forgot your...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.59,0:12:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我身材完美的老婆在这呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There she is, my perfectly proportioned wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别看我  我从来没有听懂过他的笑话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't look at me. I never get his jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢你  -不  不  别谢我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Thank you?   -No, no. Don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. Do you know
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你不要改变任何一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}there is not one thing I would change about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不要变  而且特别是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not one single thing. And definitely not...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.18,0:12:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那两点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}two single things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  你真的很怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you're being weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想上床吗  还是做了什么错事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want sex, or did you do something bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.02,0:12:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我就是爱你这模样  我爱你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No. No. I just love the way you look. I am warm
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身材\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for your form.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:13:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,传统上  一般都是说 "你很漂亮"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you know the old classics like, you know, ''You look nice''?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这句话还适用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're still okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是"你很漂亮"可能只是代表\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But ''you look nice'' could mean that I'm saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"你的脸蛋看起来漂亮"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}''Your face looks nice.''
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要赞美你的身体\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to compliment your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我一点都不想它改变\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I wouldn't change it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且更详细地说  就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And more specifically,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.55,0:13:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让任何部位变大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wouldn't want anything to get any bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  -我是说...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Okay.  - I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不会想要我身体的某部份变大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you wouldn't want any part of me to get any bigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此题不用回答\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.18,0:13:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为那老兄不可能更怪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just when you thought that dude couldn't get any weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.22,0:13:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他  为什么要担心我会变大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do you think he was so worried about me getting bigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  这事儿从何而起啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. I mean, what brought that on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  我们正努力要怀孕...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. You know what, we're trying to get pregnant...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他可能  很怕我的身材会变形\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so he's probably starting to freak out that my body's gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.25,0:13:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为是这样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think that's what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也听到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"不要变大  你很完美了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}''No bigger. You're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.75,0:13:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再变大了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just don't get any bigger.''
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  他听起来就像是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God, he sounded just like
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我高中的摔角教练\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}my high-school wrestling coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须要跟钱德勒谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna have to talk to Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.89,0:14:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  如果你不去  我去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. If you don't, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.27,0:14:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的身材必然会走样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course your body's gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的胸部会变大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your breasts are gonna get bigger...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.15,0:14:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的屁股会变大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...your ass is gonna get bigger...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的膀胱会失控\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}.you're gonna lose bladder control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  真是奇妙的过程啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, it's just such a magical time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我想向你请教关于婚姻的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Listen, I wanted to ask you something about marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  现在你是跑来取笑我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, great. Now you're seeking me out to make jokes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家在一起的时候被取笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I can see
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以理解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}if we're all hanging out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.25,0:14:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是跑到我家来...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but to come to my home....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我真的想知道你的意见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I really want to know how you feel about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克永远不想要结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mike doesn't ever want to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-永远吗   -永远\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Never? - Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  你还要跟他同居吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Are you still gonna move in with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想啊  但是我要你告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to, but I wanted you to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结婚真的没什么大不了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that marriage really isn't that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没结婚也不必后悔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, that I won't be missing out on anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为婚姻烂毙了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That marriage stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:15:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  婚姻烂毙了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, marriage stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想看到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, if you want to see
