Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.75,0:15:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是你真正的感觉  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not how you really feel, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这不是你想听到的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know it's not what you want to hear,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我没有办法说谎  我喜欢结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I can't help it. I love marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  你这个"离婚专家"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seriously, you? ''Divorce-o''?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要帮我取绰号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you have to call me a name,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我比较喜欢   "罗斯  离婚王"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd prefer ''Ross, the Divorcer.''
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来较酷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道我的婚姻并不成功\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I know my marriages didn't exactly work out...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我喜欢  两个人可以如此的投入\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but, you know, I loved being that committed to another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在卡罗尔变成女同性恋之前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Carol and I had some good times
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.69,0:15:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有过许多快乐的时光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}before she became a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.95,0:15:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后还有一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And once afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正  很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  这是你的真实感受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay. That's how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  别这样  住在一起也很棒阿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, come on, I mean, living together will be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说你们会很快乐的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you guys have so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你爱着迈克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you love Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.55,0:15:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是很爱迈克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do love Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:16:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前也很期待同居的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you were so excited about moving in together before...
