Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是很大的一步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我想你说的对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  谢谢  真有帮助  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, thanks. This helped. Thanks.
