Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-并没有比较酷  -我听到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- It's not cooler.  - Yeah, I just heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想做什么喜欢的事情都不行吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I can't do anything I like?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.34,0:17:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完美  什么都不必改变  完美无缺\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Perfection. Wouldn't change a thing. Not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-亲爱的  -怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Honey?  - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.07,0:17:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于那件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}About that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会变的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to change.
